The source_commit values in commands.json record the head captured once at batch start, 37cfaa8. They were not independently checked per command. Root committed the reviewed registration-copy accounting fix and a fixture-path test change to 819f0e9 while the batch was running. All commands returned success, but this batch is therefore not used as exact-head validation of either complete source tree. The raw logs are preserved. The separately captured verify-exact-context batch checks a clean, unchanged fixed head before and after each command and supplies the final source-specific validation.
